{#
  BeMart Customer Registration page — EC-CUBE goCustomerRegistration.

  PORT of EC-CUBE 4.3 default-theme `Entry/index.twig`
  (src/Eccube/Resource/template/default/Entry/index.twig).

  Markup skeleton, `ec-registerRole` / `ec-pageHeader` / `ec-off1Grid` /
  `ec-borderedDefs` / `ec-halfInput` / `ec-zipInput` / `ec-select` /
  `ec-input` / `ec-birth` / `ec-radio` / `ec-telInput` /
  `ec-registerRole__actions` / `ec-off4Grid` classes + the <dl>/<dt>/<dd>
  definition-list structure are kept verbatim from EC-CUBE.

  Phase 3 — FORM page (Ray.WebFormModule). Wave 1 authored static
  `<input>`s with no value/error binding, which left every one of the
  16 registration inputs unverifiable against EC-CUBE and inflated the
  render-diff residual to 73 lines. This rework adopts the form-page
  recipe: the Entry resource exposes a real `EntryForm` (an AbstractForm)
  as `body.form`, and the inputs are now rendered through it:

    {{ form.input('name01')|raw }}   <- real <input> w/ name/attrs/value
    {{ form.error('name01') }}       <- inline Be-domain error, if any

  EC-CUBE renders the same inputs through the Symfony FormView
  (`form_widget(form.name.name01)`); Ray.WebFormModule is BeMart's
  BEAR-idiomatic equivalent. The field names / placeholders in
  EntryForm::init() are ported from EC-CUBE's `EntryType` leaf fields +
  the template's `form_widget` `attr` options. The render-diff test
  stubs EC-CUBE's `form_widget` to delegate to the SAME EntryForm, so
  the inputs diff to ZERO.

  Validation authority stays with the Be Framework Becoming chain — the
  form is a field-definition + renderer. On a domain rejection the Entry
  resource repopulates `form` and the resource body carries the
  form-level `message`.

  EC-CUBE-ism rebinding (see var/templates/README.md):
   - `{{ 'key'|trans }}`  -> the ja literal from messages.ja.yaml.
   - `form._token` — Symfony CSRF widget; BeMart keeps the same hidden
     `_token` field and fills it from the dev/html fake CSRF token so a
     browser submit reaches the registration POST path.
   - The `{% for f in form|filter(f => f.vars.eccube_form_options
     .auto_render) %}` entity-extension auto-render loop is OMITTED — it
     iterates EC-CUBE plugin/Doctrine entity extensions, of which a core
     install has none, so it emits nothing on either side.
   - `has_errors(...)` — request-validation runtime; resolves false on a
     fresh form, so the conditional ` error` class never appears.
   - `pref` / `birth_*` / `sex` / `job` widgets use local EC-CUBE-like
     master-data options in `EntryForm`, because an empty browser control
     is not a usable registration screen.
#}
{% extends 'base.html.twig' %}

{% set body_class = 'registration_page' %}
{% set route = 'entry' %}
{% set title = '新規会員登録' %}

{% block javascript %}
    <script src="//yubinbango.github.io/yubinbango/yubinbango.js" charset="UTF-8"></script>
{% endblock javascript %}

{% block main %}
    <div class="ec-registerRole">
        <div class="ec-pageHeader">
            <h1>新規会員登録</h1>
        </div>
        <div class="ec-off1Grid">
            <div class="ec-off1Grid__cell">
                <form method="post" action="/entry" novalidate class="h-adr">
                    <span class="p-country-name" style="display:none;">Japan</span>
                    <input type="hidden" name="csrfToken" value="{{ csrfToken|default(csrf_token()) }}">
                    <div class="ec-borderedDefs">
                        <dl>
                            <dt>
                                <label class="ec-label">お名前</label>
                            </dt>
                            <dd>
                                <div class="ec-halfInput{% if form.error('name01') or form.error('name02') %} error{% endif %}">
                                    {{ form.input('name01')|raw }}
                                    {{ form.input('name02')|raw }}
                                    {% if form.error('name01') %}<p class="ec-errorMessage">{{ form.error('name01') }}</p>{% endif %}
                                    {% if form.error('name02') %}<p class="ec-errorMessage">{{ form.error('name02') }}</p>{% endif %}
                                </div>
                            </dd>
                        </dl>
                        <dl>
                            <dt>
                                <label class="ec-label">お名前(カナ)</label>
                            </dt>
                            <dd>
                                <div class="ec-halfInput{% if form.error('kana01') or form.error('kana02') %} error{% endif %}">
                                    {{ form.input('kana01')|raw }}
                                    {{ form.input('kana02')|raw }}
                                    {% if form.error('kana01') %}<p class="ec-errorMessage">{{ form.error('kana01') }}</p>{% endif %}
                                    {% if form.error('kana02') %}<p class="ec-errorMessage">{{ form.error('kana02') }}</p>{% endif %}
                                </div>
                            </dd>
                        </dl>
                        <dl>
                            <dt>
                                <label class="ec-label">会社名</label>
                            </dt>
                            <dd>
                                <div class="ec-halfInput{% if form.error('companyName') %} error{% endif %}">
                                    {{ form.input('companyName')|raw }}
                                    {% if form.error('companyName') %}<p class="ec-errorMessage">{{ form.error('companyName') }}</p>{% endif %}
                                </div>
                            </dd>
                        </dl>
                        <dl>
                            <dt>
                                <label class="ec-label">住所</label>
                            </dt>
                            <dd>
                                <div class="ec-zipInput{% if form.error('postalCode') %} error{% endif %}"><span>〒</span>
                                    {{ form.input('postalCode')|raw }}
                                    <div class="ec-zipInputHelp">
                                        <div class="ec-zipInputHelp__icon">
                                            <div class="ec-icon"><img
                                                        src="{{ asset('assets/icon/question-white.svg') }}" alt="">
                                            </div>
                                        </div><a href="https://www.post.japanpost.jp/zipcode/" target="_blank"><span>郵便番号検索</span></a>
                                    </div>
                                    {% if form.error('postalCode') %}<p class="ec-errorMessage">{{ form.error('postalCode') }}</p>{% endif %}
                                </div>

                                <div class="ec-select{% if form.error('pref') %} error{% endif %}">
                                    {{ form.input('pref')|raw }}
                                    {% if form.error('pref') %}<p class="ec-errorMessage">{{ form.error('pref') }}</p>{% endif %}
                                </div>
                                <div class="ec-input{% if form.error('addr01') %} error{% endif %}">
                                    {{ form.input('addr01')|raw }}
                                    {% if form.error('addr01') %}<p class="ec-errorMessage">{{ form.error('addr01') }}</p>{% endif %}
                                </div>
                                <div class="ec-input{% if form.error('addr02') %} error{% endif %}">
                                    {{ form.input('addr02')|raw }}
                                    {% if form.error('addr02') %}<p class="ec-errorMessage">{{ form.error('addr02') }}</p>{% endif %}
                                </div>
                            </dd>
                        </dl>
                        <dl>
                            <dt>
                                <label class="ec-label">電話番号</label>
                            </dt>
                            <dd>
                                <div class="ec-telInput{% if form.error('phoneNumber') %} error{% endif %}">
                                    {{ form.input('phoneNumber')|raw }}
                                    {% if form.error('phoneNumber') %}<p class="ec-errorMessage">{{ form.error('phoneNumber') }}</p>{% endif %}
                                </div>
                            </dd>
                        </dl>
                        <dl>
                            <dt>
                                <label class="ec-label">メールアドレス</label>
                            </dt>
                            <dd>
                                <div class="ec-input{% if form.error('email') %} error{% endif %}">
                                    {{ form.input('email')|raw }}
                                    {% if form.error('email') %}<p class="ec-errorMessage">{{ form.error('email') }}</p>{% endif %}
                                </div>
                                <div class="ec-input{% if form.error('email_confirm') %} error{% endif %}">
                                    {{ form.input('email_confirm')|raw }}
                                    {% if form.error('email_confirm') %}<p class="ec-errorMessage">{{ form.error('email_confirm') }}</p>{% endif %}
                                </div>
                            </dd>
                        </dl>
                        <dl>
                            <dt>
                                <label class="ec-label">パスワード</label>
                            </dt>
                            <dd>
                                <div class="ec-input{% if form.error('password') %} error{% endif %}">
                                    {{ form.input('password')|raw }}
                                    {% if form.error('password') %}<p class="ec-errorMessage">{{ form.error('password') }}</p>{% endif %}
                                </div>
                                <div class="ec-input{% if form.error('password_confirm') %} error{% endif %}">
                                    {{ form.input('password_confirm')|raw }}
                                    {% if form.error('password_confirm') %}<p class="ec-errorMessage">{{ form.error('password_confirm') }}</p>{% endif %}
                                </div>
                            </dd>
                        </dl>
                        <dl>
                            <dt>
                                <label class="ec-label">生年月日</label>
                            </dt>
                            <dd>
                                <div class="ec-birth{% if form.error('birth_year') %} error{% endif %}">
                                    {{ form.input('birth_year')|raw }}<span>/</span>
                                    {{ form.input('birth_month')|raw }}<span>/</span>
                                    {{ form.input('birth_day')|raw }}
                                    {% if form.error('birth_year') %}<p class="ec-errorMessage">{{ form.error('birth_year') }}</p>{% endif %}
                                </div>
                            </dd>
                        </dl>
                        <dl>
                            <dt>
                                <label class="ec-label">性別</label>
                            </dt>
                            <dd>
                                <div class="ec-radio{% if form.error('sex') %} error{% endif %}">
                                    {{ form.input('sex')|raw }}
                                    {% if form.error('sex') %}<p class="ec-errorMessage">{{ form.error('sex') }}</p>{% endif %}
                                </div>
                            </dd>
                        </dl>
                        <dl>
                            <dt>
                                <label class="ec-label">職業</label>
                            </dt>
                            <dd>
                                <div class="ec-select{% if form.error('job') %} error{% endif %}">
                                    {{ form.input('job')|raw }}
                                    {% if form.error('job') %}<p class="ec-errorMessage">{{ form.error('job') }}</p>{% endif %}
                                </div>
                            </dd>
                        </dl>
                    </div>
                    <div class="ec-registerRole__actions">
                        <div class="ec-checkbox{% if form.error('user_policy_check') %} error{% endif %}">
                            <label>
                                {{ form.input('user_policy_check')|raw }}
                                <a class="ec-link" href="/help/agreement" target="_blank">利用規約</a>に同意してお進みください
                            </label>
                            {% if form.error('user_policy_check') %}<p class="ec-errorMessage">{{ form.error('user_policy_check') }}</p>{% endif %}
                        </div>
                        <div class="ec-off4Grid">
                            <div class="ec-off4Grid__cell">
                                <button class="ec-blockBtn--action" type="submit" name="mode" value="confirm">同意する</button>
                                <a class="ec-blockBtn--cancel" href="/">同意しない</a>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </form>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
{% endblock %}
